DEVIATIONS
Changes made by Hanzo AI, Inc. relative to upstream Argo CD, per Apache-2.0
Section 4(b):

- Repackaged from the Go module github.com/argoproj/argo-cd/v3 to
  github.com/hanzoai/deploy, and the embedded engine module from
  github.com/argoproj/argo-cd/gitops-engine to
  github.com/hanzoai/deploy/gitops-engine. Behaviour is unchanged by the
  rename.

- Custom resource API group renamed from argoproj.io to cd.hanzo.ai, and the
  objects in manifests/ from argocd-* to hanzocd-*. The CLI and server
  binaries are named hanzocd.

- Served surfaces are white-labelled to Hanzo CD: product name, brand marks
  (ui/src/assets/images/hanzo-*.svg) and the monochrome colour skin
  (ui/src/assets/hanzo-cd.css). Upstream prose in docs/ keeps Argo CD's name
  and URLs, which is what attribution requires.

- Container images are built by Hanzo CI and published to ghcr.io/hanzoai,
  rather than quay.io/argoproj/argocd.
